# dev stage: only the values that differ from config/defaults.env (docs/config.md).
# Plain KEY=value lines, public values only. A key not in config/defaults.env stops the deploy.
# Takes effect on the next deploy: server and ml with scripts/deploy.py, the web app with
# scripts/deploy_web.py, the APK with a manual android-release run for dev.
# Nothing differs yet; for example, to test the rate limit quickly:
# SNAP_PER_HOUR=3
